<FONT COLOR="#FFFFFF" face="sans-serif">All I can say is wow, and hello OoO. I know most of you dont know me. Perhaps except Charoth, Valandra and a few others do know me.<BR><BR>My character was Abaddon of The Pentagram Order before it became The Order and then Order of Oblivion. <BR><BR>I am glad to see things are well for the guild and many old members have stayed. Amazing! I had some good times with many of you...including Morlat if hes still Order and Charoth.  <BR><BR>When I left OoO shoprtly thereafter I quit EQ. It dominated my life, I put soo many hours into that damn website and content to make things great for soo many people, I didnt realized what I was missing in life. I may have even dissapointed some people and for that I apologize.<BR><BR>Currently I am turning 27 years old soon. I am engaged to be married in June 14th 2003 to my fiancee of 7 years. Yes, the same girl I was with when I was in Beta with Aldor. By the way, does Aldor play anymore? Did he graduate from the College in Hawaii and is he still with that hot chick from Switzerland? Well, I realize that is in the past over 2 years ago...was just curious whats going on. I stumbled across a cazic thule guild locater and found this guild. Brought back many good memories.<BR><BR>I dont know if you old members know what actually happened and why I left. If interested please reply and Ill be happy to tell you what went wrong, whats going on today and future. Im excited that I foudn this site and look forward to hearing from you.<BR><BR>Sincerely<BR><BR>Adam (aka Abaddon, aka Semjaza the Fallen, aka Cero Frost)<BR><BR><font size=-1>[ This Message was edited by: Adam on 2002-03-19 09:09 ]</font></FONT><BR>
